  "description": "A break with your companion: ten games you play against it beside it on the desktop (trivia, tic-tac-toe, Copy Me and more) and five puzzles of your own (Daily Word, Sudoku and more), with your scores, best times and streaks kept, and chance to pick a number or choose from a list.",
